  "description": "The temple of the god Belili, Ekadima (\u201cHouse Which Creates ...\u201d), was located in the Kumar district of Babylon, in the western half of the inner city. According to the Babylonian topographical text Tintir = Babylon Tablet IV, it was one of seven temples in that part of Babylon.",
